on:Overall weather trends and patterns for the forecast period example:[Overall temperature trend: Warming up over the forecast period Rain expected on 2 day(s) during the forecast period] items:map[type:string] type:array]] type:object]] map[description:传入date获取date对应日期和时间的详细信息，只要问今天适合干什么，问今天的运势，只要关于运气，玄学等等关于气运的都要调用这个接口。
